{"5013280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Twigs and Firewood", "steam_appid": 5013280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slow down. Gather. Rest by the fire.</h2>Twigs &amp; Firewood is a cozy first-person game about gentle days in an autumn woodland. There's no rush and nothing to fear — just the quiet pleasure of tidying a glade, tending a warm fire, and making each little camp your own.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5013280/extras/3a65dcbc63aff6b6fff8cac7229a5b12.poster.avif?t=1786691516\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5013280/extras/3a65dcbc63aff6b6fff8cac7229a5b12.webm?t=1786691516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5013280/extras/3a65dcbc63aff6b6fff8cac7229a5b12.mp4?t=1786691516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather every twig</h2>Wander sun-dappled clearings and collect the twigs, sticks and logs scattered across the ground. Sweep them into tidy piles with a rake or broom, and carry your firewood back to camp.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A warm fire and a full pot</h2>Feed your campfire until it's a roaring blaze, forage mushrooms and vegetables, and cook hearty meals in the pot. Sell your firewood for coins — or keep it to keep the fire glowing. Every gentle day ends with a rest by the fire.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5013280/extras/8053bb71d2421f0846ad5a57ecf297bb.poster.avif?t=1786691516\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5013280/extras/8053bb71d2421f0846ad5a57ecf297bb.webm?t=1786691516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5013280/extras/8053bb71d2421f0846ad5a57ecf297bb.mp4?t=1786691516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make each place your own</h2>Spend your coins in the camp shop on <strong>tools</strong> that make gathering easier, cozy <strong>comforts</strong> to decorate your camp — string lanterns, woven rugs, log benches, wind chimes — and whole new <strong>campsites</strong> to build in far-off areas.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wander at your own pace</h2>Travel between peaceful, themed areas — a babbling creek, a pine wood, a sunny meadow, an orchard and more — each with its own light and mood. Watch the day drift from bright morning to a firefly-lit evening.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Relaxing, no-fail gathering — no timers, no enemies, no game-overs<br></li><li>Tend a living campfire and cook meals in the pot<br></li><li>A cozy shop of tools, comforts and campsites to work toward<br></li><li>Multiple themed areas to explore and tidy<br></li><li>Choose your time of day and unwind to gentle music and woodland ambience<br></li><li>Fully playable in 14 languages</li></ul><br>Pull up a log, light the fire, and stay a while.", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slow down. Gather. Rest by the fire.</h2>Twigs &amp; Firewood is a cozy first-person game about gentle days in an autumn woodland. There's no rush and nothing to fear — just the quiet pleasure of tidying a glade, tending a warm fire, and making each little camp your own.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5013280/extras/3a65dcbc63aff6b6fff8cac7229a5b12.poster.avif?t=1786691516\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5013280/extras/3a65dcbc63aff6b6fff8cac7229a5b12.webm?t=1786691516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5013280/extras/3a65dcbc63aff6b6fff8cac7229a5b12.mp4?t=1786691516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather every twig</h2>Wander sun-dappled clearings and collect the twigs, sticks and logs scattered across the ground. Sweep them into tidy piles with a rake or broom, and carry your firewood back to camp.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A warm fire and a full pot</h2>Feed your campfire until it's a roaring blaze, forage mushrooms and vegetables, and cook hearty meals in the pot. Sell your firewood for coins — or keep it to keep the fire glowing. Every gentle day ends with a rest by the fire.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5013280/extras/8053bb71d2421f0846ad5a57ecf297bb.poster.avif?t=1786691516\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5013280/extras/8053bb71d2421f0846ad5a57ecf297bb.webm?t=1786691516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5013280/extras/8053bb71d2421f0846ad5a57ecf297bb.mp4?t=1786691516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make each place your own</h2>Spend your coins in the camp shop on <strong>tools</strong> that make gathering easier, cozy <strong>comforts</strong> to decorate your camp — string lanterns, woven rugs, log benches, wind chimes — and whole new <strong>campsites</strong> to build in far-off areas.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wander at your own pace</h2>Travel between peaceful, themed areas — a babbling creek, a pine wood, a sunny meadow, an orchard and more — each with its own light and mood. Watch the day drift from bright morning to a firefly-lit evening.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Relaxing, no-fail gathering — no timers, no enemies, no game-overs<br></li><li>Tend a living campfire and cook meals in the pot<br></li><li>A cozy shop of tools, comforts and campsites to work toward<br></li><li>Multiple themed areas to explore and tidy<br></li><li>Choose your time of day and unwind to gentle music and woodland ambience<br></li><li>Fully playable in 14 languages</li></ul><br>Pull up a log, light the fire, and stay a while.", "short_description": "A cozy first-person woodland game. Wander autumn glades gathering twigs and firewood, tend a crackling campfire, cook hearty meals, and travel between peaceful areas — buying tools, comforts and campsites to make each spot your own. No pressure, no fail states: just gentle days by the fire.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5013280/9d82102f03c9f3f4fa0e943ae7a3d530d80049a6/header.jpg?t=1786691516", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5013280/5b0df16c0d9fb926c0b30acc5131761ba7f06190/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786691516", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5013280/5b0df16c0d9fb926c0b30acc5131761ba7f06190/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786691516", "website": "https://meridianstudios.games", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core x86-64, 2.4 GHz (Intel Core i3 or AMD equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GPU with Direct3D 12 / Vulkan 1.0 support — integrated OK (Intel HD 520 / UHD 600, NVIDIA GTX 900 series, or AMD Radeon RX 400 or newer)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any integrated audio<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> First-person 3D (Godot Forward+, Direct3D 12). Graphics are scalable — render scale, shadows, ambient occlusion, bloom, fog and foliage density can be lowered for weaker hardware.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04 LTS / SteamOS 3.x or newer (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core x86-64, 2.4 GHz (Intel Core i3 or AMD equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Vulkan 1.0-capable GPU with Mesa 22+ drivers — integrated OK<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> PulseAudio / PipeWire compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Verified on Steam Deck. Requires Vulkan (Mesa 22+), glibc 2.35+. Graphics settings are scalable for lower-end hardware.</li></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "© 2026 Meridian Studios. All rights reserved.<br />\r\nTwigs & Firewood™ is a trademark of Meridian Studios.", "developers": ["Meridian Studios"], "publishers": ["Meridian Studios"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 598, "final": 598, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$5.98"}, "packages": [1738730], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Twigs and Firewood", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1738730, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "Twigs and Firewood - $5.98", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_discount": 598}]}], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": tr